        "body": {
          "en-US": {
            "nodeType": "document",
            "data": {},
            "content": [
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "Agency Snags First Gold Award for Its Own Rebranding Work Plus Wins for Toyota, McDonald’s and Smart & Final",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "italic"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "The Telly Awards, honoring excellence in video and television across all screens, has announced this year’s winners, including seven wins for Davis Elen Advertising, one of the largest independently owned advertising agencies on the West Coast.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "The agency has previously won 36 Telly awards since 2015 but never before has it won the Gold. Most notably, this year marks another new milestone in the company’s achievements, as three of the agency’s victories this year came from the work done on its own rebranding.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "“It’s an honor to be recognized by the Telly’s and to receive these awards. I want to thank our creatives for their relentless dedication to their craft and the individual team members in account, media, broadcast and production for contributing to this achievement. Culturally, we want to inspire, enrich and uplift everyone who’s a member of our family and moments like this go a long way in doing that.”",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "italic"
                      }
                    ],
                    "data": {}
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "– David Moranville, Co-President and Chief Creative Officer.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "The remaining four of the seven Telly Awards Davis Elen won this year were split among its prestigious roster of clients ",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "uri": "https://www.toyota.com/"
                    },
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "nodeType": "text",
                        "value": "Toyota",
                        "marks": [],
                        "data": {}
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": ", ",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "uri": "https://www.mcdonalds.com/us/en-us.html"
                    },
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "nodeType": "text",
                        "value": "McDonald’s",
                        "marks": [],
                        "data": {}
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": " and ",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "uri": "https://www.smartandfinal.com/"
                    },
                    "content": [
                      {
