                      "id": "youtube-PoZafVnDXEY"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "content": []
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "heading-2",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "Smart & Final RedZoneRush™",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "WINNER: SILVER, BRANDED CONTENT, SOCIAL",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "paragraph",
                "data": {},
                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "Davis Elen was tasked by its client to introduce an ownable, integrated campaign driven by social-first content across multiple markets. The goal was to convert followers into customers during one of the biggest shopping weekends of the year, the Super Bowl. Davis Elen introduced the RedZoneRush™ campaign, which was an interactive experience that engaged and entertained customers in the social space. Driven by hyper-relevant meme content, Davis Elen placed comedic posts in real-time during",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "uri": "https://www.miasbliv.com/"
                    },
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "nodeType": "text",
                        "value": "Super Bowl LIV",
                        "marks": [],
                        "data": {}
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": ". The content generated 12 million+ impressions and 65k+ engagements across all platforms. With the success of the RedZoneRush™ campaign, the agency has successfully embraced and implemented a new comedic tone on the",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "hyperlink",
                    "data": {
                      "uri": "https://www.instagram.com/smartfinal/?hl=en"
                    },
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "nodeType": "text",
                        "value": "@SmartFinal",
                        "marks": [],
                        "data": {}
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "social handles that continues to grow, engage, and entertain its audience.",
                    "marks": [],
                    "data": {}
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "nodeType": "embedded-asset-block",
                "data": {
                  "target": {
                    "sys": {
                      "type": "Link",
                      "linkType": "Asset",
                      "id": "asset-0c0870d569d0"
                    }
